msgstr "ریکپچا نسخه 2"

#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1406
msgid "reCAPTCHA v3"
msgstr "ریکپچای نسخه 3"

#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1415
#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1432
msgid "Site Key"
msgstr "کلید سایت (Site Key)"

#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1416
#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1433
msgid ""
"You can register your site and generate a site key via <a href=\"https://"
"www.google.com/recaptcha/\">Google reCAPTCHA</a>"
msgstr ""
"می‌توانید سایت خود را ثبت کنید و یک کلید سایت از طریق <a href=\"https://www.google.com/"
"recaptcha/\">Google reCAPTCHA</a> تولید کنید"

#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1422
#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1439
msgid "Secret Key"
msgstr "کلید مخفی (Secret Key)"

#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1423
#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1440
msgid ""
"Keep this a secret. You can get your secret key via <a href=\"https://www.google.com/"
"recaptcha/\">Google reCAPTCHA</a>"
msgstr ""
"این را مخفی نگه دارید. می‌توانید کلید مخفی خود را از طریق <a href=\"https://"
"www.google.com/recaptcha/\">Google reCAPTCHA</a> دریافت کنید"

#: admin/includes/classes/class-options-panel.php:1448
